      "description": "A coordinated effort by several mid-sized EU member states, frustrated by the Union's inability to secure independent access to frontier AI, begins quiet negotiations with Japan, South Korea, and Canada to form a joint evaluation and assurance framework for AI systems. The initiative focuses on shared red-teaming, model certification, and compute resource pooling, aiming to create a 'safe tier' of interoperable systems outside U.S. or Chinese dominance.",
